  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ba47e096-c85f-4ecf-af06-6e1c782d618b-image.png\" style=\"width: 306px; height: 239px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>180</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>so distance between extreme point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p>",
